title: The relevant implementation, callers, tests, and focused documentation for the requested behavior.
pid: 39c24f61-4d92-46ae-b309-0dcb7a2b8cc8
body: |2-
  Do not read all documentation or TODO material as onboarding; it's too much.
  Consult a plan, open question, or historical note
  only when the current task points to it.
  The external knowledge graph is optional background material, not required
  orientation: the repository's code and local documentation contain the
  operative information for implementation.
